{"seq":34,"slug":"personal-knowledge-management","title":"个人知识管理","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management","rating":{"composite":3.98,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 个人知识管理\n\n每个程序员都面临同一个困境：技术文档读了上千篇，浏览器书签堆到溢出，却在真正需要某个方案时搜不到、想不起、用不上。个人知识管理（PKM）解决的正是这个问题——它不是「记笔记」，而是建立一套让知识持续复利的系统：捕获的每条信息都在为未来的决策和创作蓄力。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于「从零搭建并持续运转一套 PKM 系统」的完整路径。与兄弟 hub 的分工边界如下：\n\n- **写作即思考**（`15_writing-as-thinking`）侧重「用写作驱动思维清晰度」，是 PKM 的输出层之一；本 hub 涵盖从捕获到输出的全链路，写作只是最终表达的一种形态。\n- **目标执行与习惯系统**（`09_goal-execution-habit-systems`）关注行动力与习惯回路；本 hub 关注的是知识层面的组织与检索，两者在「每周回顾」等实践中有交叉但侧重不同。\n- **创意与创新思维**（`16_creativity-innovation-thinking`）关注发散与收敛的认知模式；本 hub 的 Zettelkasten 等方法恰好为创意涌现提供结构化基底。\n\n推荐学习路径：\n\n1. **基础认知**（第一章）：理解 PKM 的核心循环与认知科学基础，建立「为什么要做」的内驱力。\n2. **方法论选型**（第二章）：深入 Zettelkasten、PARA、BASB 三大流派，根据自身角色选择或混合。\n3. **工具落地**（第三章）：在 Obsidian、Notion 等工具中实现方法论，并利用 2026 年 AI 能力加速知识图谱构建。\n4. **日常实践**（第四章）：将 PKM 从「偶尔整理」变成「每日运转」的自动化工作流。\n\n前置知识：无硬性前置要求。具备基础的 Markdown 读写能力和任一笔记工具使用经验会更顺畅；对图数据结构有概念性了解有助于理解 Zettelkasten 的链接机制。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"知识管理基础认知","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-pkm","title":"什么是个人知识管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/foundations/what-is-pkm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cognitive-science-of-knowledge","title":"知识的认知科学基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/foundations/cognitive-science-of-knowledge"},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-lifecycle","title":"信息生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/foundations/information-lifecycle"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"systems","title":"知识管理方法论体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"zettelkasten-method","title":"Zettelkasten 卡片盒方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/systems/zettelkasten-method"},{"seq":2,"slug":"para-organization","title":"PARA 组织体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/systems/para-organization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"building-second-brain","title":"构建第二大脑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/systems/building-second-brain"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tools","title":"工具生态与 AI 增强","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"obsidian-ecosystem","title":"Obsidian 生态与本地优先知识库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/tools/obsidian-ecosystem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"notion-knowledge-base","title":"Notion 知识库架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/tools/notion-knowledge-base"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-augmented-pkm","title":"AI 增强的知识管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/tools/ai-augmented-pkm"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"日常实践与工作流","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capture-and-intake","title":"信息捕获与输入工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/practice/capture-and-intake"},{"seq":2,"slug":"linking-and-retrieval","title":"链接与检索策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/practice/linking-and-retrieval"},{"seq":3,"slug":"output-and-expression","title":"知识输出与表达工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-knowledge-management/practice/output-and-expression"}]}]}